--- !u!114 &560567801
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 560567799}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 392c0312a193c3e43943423eae29d5cc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialSize: 55
  initialSpeed: 0.015
  dialogs:
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Merchants always know how to arrive just where there's a need!
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "This time, it's a height so tall you can\u2019t even see the top."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Looks like the developers are really running out of ideas.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Let me see what it says here.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "\u201CYou can throw the sword hilt...\u201D"
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Such a long explanation, it\u2019s making my head hurt."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Basically, you throw the hilt and then teleport to its location.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: And when the hilt hits special walls, it has special effects.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "That\u2019s all about it, so go ahead and try it yourself!"
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
