--- !u!114 &724045114
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 724045112}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 392c0312a193c3e43943423eae29d5cc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialSize: 55
  initialSpeed: 0.015
  dialogs:
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "We\u2019re almost at Mountain Fushui."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 1
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "/size:up/Aha!/wait:0.5//size:init/ \nfinally going to find a scapegoat."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Let\u2019s try negotiating first,/wait:0.5/\nif that doesn\u2019t
      work then..."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 1
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Negotiating?
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 1
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: You still think you can solve this through talking, Qin?
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Killing is always the last resort.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 1
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Little girl,/wait:0.5/ \nthat\u2019s exactly why you swing me but
      never take even a life."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: At least I wil stick to my principles.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 1
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Don\u2019t forget, your life is on a countdown."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: 'Last 3 years.../wait:0.5/

      and one year has already passed.'
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: And that championship the knowledge-holders created is start in next
      month.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Is championship the only way to survive...?
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: (Should I kill others just to live?)
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 1
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: By the way,/wait:0.5/using a bird as transportation is pretty ridiculous.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: . /wait:0.5/. /wait:0.5/.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 3
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "(Isn\u2019t this one of your spells?)"
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "( I\u2019d prefer to be more low-key.)"
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 1
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: You do realize that the connection of our minds is part of this shared
      life bond, right?
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 1
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Also, I don\u2019t talk to ridiculous birds.?"
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 3
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Also, I don\u2019t talk to ridiculous birds.?"
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
