--- !u!114 &1088430869
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1088430867}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 392c0312a193c3e43943423eae29d5cc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialSize: 55
  initialSpeed: 0.015
  dialogs:
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Hi, beautiful girl over there!
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "You\u2019ve got a pretty cool sword hilt.../wait:0.5/\nthough it seems
      like it's missing a blade?\n"
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "If you need a complete sword, I\u2019ve got plenty.\n"
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: The prices are quite reasonable!
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Oops, my professional habits kicked in.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "I\u2019m Caiyu,/wait:0.5/ a character who will appear in the full
      version of the game."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Originally, I wasn\u2019t supposed to appear in this demo."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: But money talks.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "I bribed developers a bit,\nso now I\u2019m your instructor for this
      mode."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: 'If you want, you can call me/wait:0.5/

      /size:80/Teacher Caiyu.'
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Now, let\u2019s begin the first lesson."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "Normally, you wouldn\u2019t be able to jump up to that height in front
      of you."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: But if you inject Qi into your sword hilt, you can perform a double
      jump.
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "It also seems like there\u2019s a charge-and-float function."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: "At least that\u2019s what the script says."
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - sentenceIndex: 
    firstCharacter: 1
    secondCharacter: 0
    emotion: 
    isSkippable: 1
    sentence: Anyway, give it a try!
    callback:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
